WEBVTT

00:16.018 --> 00:18.852
This is the chaotic time of
spontaneous gangs.

00:19.727 --> 00:20.893
In order to scramble for territory...

00:21.643 --> 00:23.267
they are not afraid
to purge each other...

00:23.268 --> 00:24.268
despite the rules.

00:26.602 --> 00:27.102
Butcher...

00:28.560 --> 00:29.060
slaughter...

00:30.893 --> 00:31.977
to survive.

00:33.935 --> 00:35.643
Until the formation of four forces.

00:38.227 --> 00:40.518
These four hold hundreds of juniors
under their command...

00:40.727 --> 00:43.018
creating a balance in the underworld
during the time.

00:45.060 --> 00:46.852
They are known as:

00:47.518 --> 00:47.977
Cuong...

00:49.185 --> 00:50.435
Area: Cho Lon - Weapon: Chopper
Business: Protection, loaning.

00:50.477 --> 00:51.185
Hao...

00:52.560 --> 00:54.018
Area: Float Market - Weapon: Scimitar
Business: Protection, smuggling.

00:54.310 --> 00:54.810
Chan...

00:55.935 --> 00:57.185
Area: Cau Muoi Market - Weapon: Ice saw
Business: Protection, restaurants.

00:57.268 --> 00:57.602
Hung.

00:58.602 --> 00:59.935
Area: Night Market - Weapon: Pig chopper
knife Business: Smuggling, prostitute.

01:00.102 --> 01:05.018
UNTIL ONE DAY...

01:12.540 --> 01:12.873
Hung!

01:14.040 --> 01:14.915
Why did you do this?

01:16.331 --> 01:18.206
- I didn't want to…
- Then don't!

01:18.290 --> 01:19.248
But if we don't do this, his mom…

01:19.248 --> 01:20.206
Then do you have any ideas?

01:24.581 --> 01:25.665
I follow them.

01:29.974 --> 01:31.360
Gangster is a one-way road.

01:32.706 --> 01:34.040
Once you've entered...

01:34.540 --> 01:35.623
you can only go straight forward.

01:35.915 --> 01:36.959
There's no turning back.

02:17.165 --> 02:18.631
The rules of Cho Lon are simple.

02:20.748 --> 02:21.764
Do not sell out brothers.

02:22.228 --> 02:23.436
Do not associate with other gangs.

02:23.956 --> 02:25.264
Every man for himself.

02:25.624 --> 02:27.374
Keep what is yours.

02:28.457 --> 02:30.207
The four areas are well defined.

02:31.041 --> 02:31.416
Cuong...

02:31.541 --> 02:31.916
Hao...

02:32.499 --> 02:32.874
Chan...

02:33.291 --> 02:33.959
and Hung.

02:39.001 --> 02:40.521
Hai Cuong's Cho Lon is the most fierce.

02:42.666 --> 02:43.428
Cau Muoi...

02:43.800 --> 02:44.467
belongs to Chan.

02:45.124 --> 02:45.850
Night Market...

02:46.541 --> 02:47.483
is Hac Hung's area.

02:51.683 --> 02:52.474
Float Market...

02:53.207 --> 02:53.975
Hao.

02:56.374 --> 02:59.030
The Cho Lon is located in the middle
of the arterial road in goods trading.

02:59.488 --> 03:02.084
The other three had joined forces
to assassinate Hai Cuong.

03:04.166 --> 03:06.041
I have no clues about
Big Brother's current situation...

03:07.749 --> 03:11.288
but we must follow his rules.

03:12.374 --> 03:16.332
All but two things can be traded here...

03:18.874 --> 03:19.541
humans...

03:23.152 --> 03:23.983
and drugs.

03:41.332 --> 03:48.831
3 – THE RULES

03:48.832 --> 03:50.311
How is Hai Cuong's situation?

03:52.499 --> 03:53.819
If it were that simple to track him down...

03:54.207 --> 03:55.475
it wouldn't be him.

03:57.499 --> 03:59.374
Why didn't you let your juniors
take them down?

04:00.166 --> 04:02.944
He's in the dark,
and you're in the light now.

04:03.707 --> 04:04.582
Are you scared?

04:04.749 --> 04:05.749
If you're scared...

04:05.750 --> 04:07.207
then I'm gonna
finish them off all by myself!

04:07.666 --> 04:08.582
It's the Cho Lon gang!

04:08.791 --> 04:10.374
The North Port gang can't wait any longer.

04:10.749 --> 04:12.124
They need to deliver the drugs urgently.

04:12.332 --> 04:13.124
And I need money.

04:13.999 --> 04:14.709
Calm down!

04:15.624 --> 04:16.498
Drink!

04:22.624 --> 04:25.624
In two months, Cho Lon will be ours.

04:55.166 --> 04:56.444
Please count to check
if it's enough or not.

04:58.624 --> 04:59.202
Alright.

05:04.832 --> 05:06.139
Catch me if you can!

05:06.916 --> 05:08.916
See how I'm gonna punish you
after this, sweety.

05:10.666 --> 05:11.457
Stop there.

05:13.457 --> 05:14.249
Where are you running to?

05:15.832 --> 05:17.749
So that is all for this month, handsome.

05:22.207 --> 05:25.874
Brother, please have mercy on me! Please!

05:27.541 --> 05:30.499
I…I've still got some money…

05:37.082 --> 05:38.291
Which finger?

05:38.624 --> 05:40.124
Quick! Or he's gonna finish you.

05:40.499 --> 05:42.100
No…please spare me…

05:42.457 --> 05:43.420
I'll give you the money.

05:47.553 --> 05:48.483
How do you sheath this knife, Long?

05:49.582 --> 05:50.749
Jeez, let me!

06:41.999 --> 06:43.291
Hey, we're brothers, aren't we?

06:47.624 --> 06:49.999
Could you please delete
the photo of me stepping on shit?

06:52.541 --> 06:54.124
Why didn't you take the stairs, dude?

06:54.170 --> 06:55.212
It's stink!

07:04.707 --> 07:06.514
And you guys said we were brothers forever…

07:18.207 --> 07:20.349
It's only been a few months
but you guys are doing well.

07:27.041 --> 07:28.451
Here, this is yours.

07:39.749 --> 07:41.041
The police just discriminated
a scam gang...

07:41.207 --> 07:42.166
having 5,000 members.

07:42.249 --> 07:43.791
This gang scammed over 100 billion dong.

07:44.416 --> 07:45.957
Overstated 300-hundred billion dong goods.

07:57.416 --> 07:58.690
When has Big Brother recovered?

07:59.499 --> 08:00.276
Just recently.

08:01.499 --> 08:02.822
He called right away just when he woke up.

08:05.791 --> 08:07.082
Did he tell you anything?

08:10.791 --> 08:13.354
Fuck it. There's a rat among us.

08:14.874 --> 08:16.749
Big Brother wants to
negotiate with Chan's gang.

08:17.957 --> 08:19.999
Negotiate my ass!

08:20.374 --> 08:22.082
They conspired against him like that...

08:22.392 --> 08:25.308
now he wants me
to sit with them at a table?

08:31.416 --> 08:31.916
Lu!

08:33.542 --> 08:35.454
Big Brother always has a strategy
in place before taking action.

08:37.582 --> 08:39.432
All of us should follow his lead.

09:06.207 --> 09:06.930
Big Brother...

09:07.916 --> 09:09.031
are you being too skeptical?

09:09.541 --> 09:11.203
You must set a trap
if you want to catch a mouse.

09:12.374 --> 09:13.719
How are those four kiddos?

09:14.374 --> 09:17.992
As you expected, they've adapted very well.

09:50.166 --> 09:51.582
Hey! What are you doing there?

10:06.874 --> 10:08.624
It was so close…

10:09.332 --> 10:09.812
Ba...

10:11.249 --> 10:12.041
can you recognize me?

10:12.374 --> 10:13.457
You're crazy.

10:14.124 --> 10:15.133
He's still fine.

10:16.124 --> 10:17.250
Are you sure they were trading drugs?

10:17.666 --> 10:21.291
I'm sure! It was white
and wrapped in small bags.

10:21.457 --> 10:22.706
If it weren't drugs then what was it?

10:22.707 --> 10:23.957
They could be wheat flour.

10:24.041 --> 10:25.374
You're as crazy as him.

10:25.624 --> 10:27.707
Nobody sells wheat flour in such tiny bags.

10:28.666 --> 10:29.374
Did you call me crazy?

10:29.457 --> 10:30.457
Ouch…

10:30.874 --> 10:33.249
How dare they touch Big Brother's area?

10:36.249 --> 10:38.124
I'm pretty sure someone
in our gang broke the rules.

10:39.207 --> 10:41.082
Hung, what do you think?

10:42.291 --> 10:43.374
Should we tell Hien?

10:46.332 --> 10:47.541
Come to the bar first
and we'll think about this later.

10:51.999 --> 10:52.541
Ok!

11:02.166 --> 11:03.328
You guys come sit over there.

11:03.707 --> 11:04.586
Call me if you need anything.

11:21.832 --> 11:22.430
Hey!

11:23.749 --> 11:24.836
Who are they?

11:26.874 --> 11:27.617
Night Market gang.

11:35.916 --> 11:36.416
Hey!

11:39.582 --> 11:42.499
You shouldn't have eyes
on others' property.

11:43.457 --> 11:44.406
You knew the rules.

11:46.124 --> 11:47.249
I didn't do anything, dude.

11:54.916 --> 11:56.916
Talking about seniority
in the underworld...

11:58.916 --> 12:01.541
I'm not inferior to Hai Cuong.

12:08.416 --> 12:09.883
You can't say that.

12:11.791 --> 12:14.832
We've been riding in this area
for almost 20 years...

12:15.624 --> 12:17.457
money is the ultimate purpose.

12:19.374 --> 12:22.249
Then why don't we prosper together?

12:25.457 --> 12:26.374
Am I right?

12:28.707 --> 12:29.680
You're right, Chan.

12:30.624 --> 12:31.883
Money is the goal...

12:32.999 --> 12:34.555
but we say no to drug dealing.

12:35.176 --> 12:36.617
That's Big Brother's rule.

12:40.900 --> 12:42.483
Fuck these two idiots!

12:47.037 --> 12:48.750
You're turning down money?

12:53.749 --> 12:55.957
There are two things...

12:56.124 --> 12:57.416
in this world you must use
whenever you own it.

12:59.082 --> 13:01.249
The first is money.

13:02.791 --> 13:06.791
Second is women.

13:13.038 --> 13:15.347
Fuck you! Dumb bitch!

13:16.916 --> 13:18.355
Don't get on my nerves!

13:19.916 --> 13:23.542
Whoever stands in my way,
I'll turn them all to dust!

13:25.957 --> 13:27.183
If something gets dirty...

13:33.374 --> 13:34.041
get rid of it!

13:36.499 --> 13:37.166
Fuck off!

13:49.666 --> 13:50.832
So hasty!

13:53.249 --> 13:54.874
It was just an accident.

14:38.707 --> 14:39.874
What are you staring at?

15:08.749 --> 15:09.582
I'm telling you two...

15:12.082 --> 15:14.582
you should consider what Chan said.

15:17.082 --> 15:17.916
It's money!

15:20.124 --> 15:21.957
No matter what Hai Cuong has given you...

15:22.832 --> 15:24.082
we could do the same.

15:25.207 --> 15:28.624
Even more.

15:30.832 --> 15:31.473
Alright.

15:33.166 --> 15:35.374
I invite you here tonight to have fun.

15:36.374 --> 15:38.166
We'll discuss this later
after Hai Cuong is fully recovered.

15:39.124 --> 15:40.666
Everybody, cheers!

15:40.874 --> 15:41.999
No limits tonight!

17:03.916 --> 17:06.249
Hey, you. Please have some passion!

17:06.707 --> 17:08.312
Just do what you want!

17:08.457 --> 17:09.937
Can't you hear
how passionate the other side is?

17:15.999 --> 17:16.999
If you wanna play game, go home!

17:20.562 --> 17:22.104
How long have you been doing this?

17:23.874 --> 17:25.416
Don't you plan to get married?

17:27.249 --> 17:29.124
What if your parents knew?

17:30.874 --> 17:32.291
Oh, where are you from?

17:33.291 --> 17:34.281
What's your name?

17:52.499 --> 17:54.124
How about we actually do it?

18:05.124 --> 18:06.249
Ten more minutes and you can rest.

18:21.332 --> 18:22.377
Are you okay?

18:24.332 --> 18:25.174
I'm fine!

18:28.082 --> 18:29.064
Let's go!

18:32.499 --> 18:33.213
Go!

18:36.666 --> 18:38.457
Damn! She was no different from a corpse.

18:38.707 --> 18:39.449
How about yours?

18:39.791 --> 18:40.582
So fierce!

18:56.291 --> 18:57.684
Seems like he's not as naive as I thought.

18:58.249 --> 18:59.215
Damn, he has a good eye.

18:59.916 --> 19:01.082
Cut it out, let's go!

19:05.749 --> 19:06.653
Sorry, buddy.

19:11.832 --> 19:13.374
Brothers forever my ass.

19:15.124 --> 19:15.809
Sweety pie...

19:16.666 --> 19:17.606
wanna hang out with me?

19:42.082 --> 19:43.582
Who are you dreaming of
that you seem spacing out?

19:45.027 --> 19:45.819
Dad.

19:46.916 --> 19:47.473
What?

19:48.416 --> 19:49.590
Just my dad.

19:54.291 --> 19:56.637
If you wouldn't be a gangster...

19:57.374 --> 19:58.449
what would you do instead?

20:04.416 --> 20:06.124
You called me out
just to ask that question?

20:15.749 --> 20:19.124
There are many things
we don't get to choose.

20:22.916 --> 20:23.666
That's right.

20:24.791 --> 20:25.832
Just like...

20:26.249 --> 20:28.624
we don't get to choose
the family we were born into.

20:43.999 --> 20:45.291
What's wrong with my nurse today?

20:48.749 --> 20:49.790
Dad wants me to come back...

20:49.791 --> 20:51.279
and support him
to handle my family's business.

20:53.124 --> 20:54.306
I think that's good.

20:55.416 --> 20:57.994
Working at the ward's medical center
is too toilsome.

20:59.666 --> 21:01.619
You're always dealing with
such nasty patients.

21:03.207 --> 21:05.166
The nasty patient is you.

21:06.791 --> 21:08.582
You're always solving problems
with violence.

21:10.082 --> 21:10.892
Oh, yeah…

21:19.916 --> 21:20.332
Hey...

21:21.957 --> 21:22.707
don't be so gloomy.

23:48.707 --> 23:49.582
Hello?

23:51.291 --> 23:52.166
Long! Help me!

24:04.957 --> 24:05.582
Long, hurry!

24:16.249 --> 24:16.957
Let me!

25:05.832 --> 25:07.707
You knew the rules
and yet you still touched my chick.

25:08.041 --> 25:08.832
You mother fucker!

26:02.041 --> 26:02.707
Run!

26:17.832 --> 26:18.710
You fucking retarded!

26:19.541 --> 26:20.916
Does Cho Lon lack room for you to play?

26:21.041 --> 26:22.791
They trapped me… / Not your turn to speak!

26:24.249 --> 26:25.290
Let's gather our brothers and kill them!

26:25.291 --> 26:25.999
Bastard!

26:27.041 --> 26:28.791
Can you protect hundreds
of brothers in our gang?

26:39.041 --> 26:40.457
You're being rebellious now, aren't you?

26:46.166 --> 26:47.457
They didn't accept this.

26:48.166 --> 26:50.624
They insist on making
Big Brother apologize directly.

26:51.124 --> 26:53.832
Otherwise, they'll make us pay.

26:55.166 --> 26:56.249
Phong was trapped.

26:57.666 --> 26:59.082
Let us come apologize to them.

27:02.666 --> 27:04.207
It is their right to set him up.

27:05.416 --> 27:07.249
But only idiots would fall into the trap.

27:13.332 --> 27:14.240
There's a phone call for you.

27:28.332 --> 27:28.999
Hung...

27:30.582 --> 27:32.291
can we meet and talk?

27:35.582 --> 27:36.582
I want to see you first.

27:38.124 --> 27:40.166
The other two conditions
will be responded to later.

27:56.541 --> 27:57.666
Ba, what the hell are you doing?

27:59.874 --> 28:01.470
Who asked you to self-sabotage like that?

28:10.082 --> 28:11.111
I'm sorry.

28:12.666 --> 28:13.582
You know your fault now, huh?

28:16.207 --> 28:18.541
I should've let them beat you to death.

28:19.874 --> 28:21.041
Maybe I should leave the gang.

28:22.207 --> 28:22.999
What are you saying?

28:23.874 --> 28:24.291
Quit it.

28:25.874 --> 28:26.832
It's no use crying over spilled milk.

28:27.541 --> 28:29.207
Leaving the gang doesn't solve anything.

28:30.416 --> 28:32.207
But I'll implicate you guys
sooner or later.

28:33.207 --> 28:34.832
Stop saying such bad luck things.

28:36.291 --> 28:37.666
I lifted the curse for you. Say it again!

28:39.624 --> 28:42.207
When I banged that chick last night...

28:42.666 --> 28:44.249
she said the Night Market
had been prospering lately.

28:45.082 --> 28:46.666
They distribute the drugs in there.

28:48.416 --> 28:49.124
Are you sure?

28:50.666 --> 28:52.082
I don't think she lied.

28:52.666 --> 28:54.082
I met her when she was getting high.

28:58.499 --> 29:00.082
If we wanna redeem this...

29:03.374 --> 29:05.041
we must find evidence at all costs.

29:13.791 --> 29:14.416
Thank you.

31:01.541 --> 31:03.749
Where are you running to?

32:08.332 --> 32:09.416
Same as previous.

32:13.666 --> 32:14.957
May I buy you a drink?

32:24.707 --> 32:26.082
Don't you know who I am?

32:28.999 --> 32:29.624
Fuck off!

32:30.541 --> 32:31.416
You dumb bitch!
